--
-- 90 evergreen topics, about three months of daily posts:
--   - the 49 Minor Arcana cards that had no article (all 22 Major Arcana and
--     7 minors were covered);
--   - 20 Cartomancy (playing-card) topics: the app reads playing cards, and
--     the blog had none;
--   - 21 gaps elsewhere: angel numbers, common dreams, moon-phase and
--     birthday spreads, the "big three", reversals, questions, court cards.
-- No keyword repeats an existing row. Briefs follow the house style.
--
-- The generator now also drafts a topic itself when the queue is empty, so
-- the blog no longer goes silent when a refill is late.
-- ============================================================================

